"Everything %(site_name)s keeps: they run the server and see the Django "
"admin, the log and the webhooks GitHub sent."
msgstr ""
"Alles, was %(site_name)s speichert: Sie betreiben den Server und sehen den "
"Django-Admin, das Protokoll und die Webhooks von GitHub."

